        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Geragos, Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton, Jim McDougal, Susan McDougal\n- Events: Whitewater controversy\n- Organizations: Whitewater Development Corporation\n- Topics: American political scandals, real estate investments\n\nFacts:\n- The Whitewater controversy was an American political episode of the 1990s.\n- The Whitewater controversy began with an investigation into the real estate investments of Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton, Jim McDougal, and Susan McDougal.\n- The investments at issue in the Whitewater controversy involved the Whitewater Development Corporation.\n- The Whitewater Development Corporation was a failed business venture in the 1970s and 1980s.\n- Mark Geragos was also involved in the Whitewater controversy.",
